config ESPHOME_API
	bool "ESPHome native API server"
	depends on NETWORKING
	select NANOPB
	help
	  Server side of the ESPHome native API (TCP, protobuf messages,
	  optional Noise encryption, mDNS discovery) so Home Assistant can
	  discover the device and read and control its entities. Only the
	  networking protocol is implemented, not ESPHome's YAML/codegen.

